(---) Tj
T*
(title: TIS User And System Flows) Tj
T*
(documentation_version: 3.7) Tj
T*
(last_updated: 2026-09-09) Tj
T*
(source_of_truth: true) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# TIS User And System Flows) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Owner Video Acceptance Flow Corrections) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Student Assessments groups configured Programs beneath each user-defined Evaluation) Tj
T*
(Period whether or not an internal Cycle already exists.) Tj
T*
(2. Selecting a Program with no Cycle does not redirect to Evaluation Plan. With the existing) Tj
T*
(Cycle-manage + Plan-manage + Period-select permissions, the browser creates the internal) Tj
T*
(Cycle, links it to that Planned Period using revision guards, then re-enters Student) Tj
T*
(Assessments with that Period/Program selected.) Tj
T*
(3. The Student roster is then the operational surface. **Start Assessment** posts the) Tj
T*
(selected Evaluation context and Student, receives the new current Assessment, and opens that) Tj
T*
(Assessment immediately.) Tj
T*
(4. The opened Assessment resolves its own persisted `program_id` and `framework_version_id`,) Tj
T*
(then renders the exact Grade-applicable Framework Competencies, competency-owned assessment) Tj
T*
(criteria/Levels/descriptions, and any saved results. The browser does not substitute another) Tj
T*
(Program's rubric.) Tj
T*
(5. Any create/start failure is surfaced in the visible operational alert region; a failed) Tj
T*
(click must not look like a no-op.) Tj
T*
(6. Delete Competency against an immutable/assessed Framework is a versioned future-change) Tj
T*
(flow only: clone the current Framework, delete from the new Draft using the dedicated) Tj
T*
(permission/revision guard, and preserve old Assessment evidence unchanged.) Tj
T*
(7. KPI numeric configuration remains separate from assessment criteria and has an explicit) Tj
T*
(disclosure/collapse control.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Students Branch And Learning Style Presentation Flow) Tj
T*
