(These standards are mandatory for future human developers, Codex conversations, ChatGPT) Tj
T*
(conversations, and technical reviewers working on TIS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Inspect Before Editing) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Before changing files:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- inspect the current code with `rg` and targeted file reads,) Tj
T*
(- understand the affected route/service/template/model,) Tj
T*
(- read relevant docs, ADRs, and module history,) Tj
T*
(- check tests for the touched module,) Tj
T*
(- check the current branch and working tree.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not code from memory when local context is available.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Plan Before Implementation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For non-trivial work:) Tj
