T*
(assumptions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Chosen solution:) Tj
T*
(Use Paddle behind service/client boundaries in `saas/`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Long-term consequences:) Tj
T*
(Provider-specific behavior must remain isolated. A future provider change would require a) Tj
T*
(new ADR and careful migration plan.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Immediate Tenant Provisioning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date:) Tj
T*
(2026-06-26) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Context:) Tj
T*
(Public signup and SaaS onboarding collect organization data before a school is ready for) Tj
T*
(live operational access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Proposed solution:) Tj
T*
(Create operational school group, branch, user, and academic records immediately after signup) Tj
T*
(or checkout return.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Why rejected:) Tj
T*
(Immediate provisioning risks creating live tenant data before payment is verified, before) Tj
T*
(onboarding is complete, or before platform owner review. Checkout return pages are not) Tj
T*
(authoritative payment confirmation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Chosen solution:) Tj
T*
(Delay tenant provisioning until payment/readiness is verified and use platform-owner-visible) Tj
T*
(provisioning jobs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Long-term consequences:) Tj
T*
(There are more states between signup and operational login, but tenant data is safer and) Tj
T*
(provisioning can be reviewed/retried.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Public Documentation Access) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date:) Tj
T*
(2026-06-26) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Context:) Tj
T*
(The KMS generates a PDF under `static/docs/`, but the content includes internal) Tj
T*
(architecture, roadmap, and operational guidance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Proposed solution:) Tj
T*
(Link directly to the generated PDF through public static paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Why rejected:) Tj
T*
(Internal documentation should not be exposed as a public asset. Static file serving is not) Tj
T*
(authorization-aware.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Chosen solution:) Tj
T*
(Expose the PDF through protected Platform Owner routes only.) Tj
T*
