T*
() Tj
T*
(# TIS Visual Documentation Guide) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This guide defines how visual documentation should evolve. No screenshots are required yet,) Tj
T*
(but future screenshots and diagrams should follow this structure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Purpose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Visual documentation should help developers, reviewers, owners, and future AI assistants) Tj
T*
(understand TIS screens, workflows, data relationships, and design expectations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Visual docs should not replace Markdown source docs. They should support them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Future Storage Location) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended future location:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(docs/visuals/) Tj
T*
(  screenshots/) Tj
T*
(  diagrams/) Tj
T*
(  flows/) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended generated/reference output:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(static/docs/visuals/) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not store sensitive production data in screenshots.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
