T*
() Tj
T*
(This is the definitive onboarding guide for future AI assistants working on TIS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Preferred Onboarding Order) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For any new AI coding conversation:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Read `docs/AI_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.) Tj
T*
(2. Read `docs/README.md`.) Tj
T*
(3. Read `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md`.) Tj
T*
(4. Read `docs/TIS_MASTER_CONTEXT.md`.) Tj
T*
(5. Read `docs/engineering/README.md`.) Tj
T*
(6. Read task-specific engineering docs.) Tj
T*
(7. Read relevant ADRs.) Tj
T*
(8. Read relevant module history.) Tj
T*
(9. Inspect code with `rg` before editing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Choosing Task-Specific Docs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use this map:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- SaaS signup/login/account: `docs/history/saas-onboarding/`, ADR 0002.) Tj
T*
(- Billing/payment/Paddle: `docs/history/subscriptions/`, ADR 0003, ADR 0004.) Tj
T*
(- Provisioning: `docs/history/provisioning/`, ADR 0005.) Tj
T*
(- Landing page: `docs/marketing/`, ADR 0001, ADR 0007.) Tj
T*
(- Platform owner/Knowledge Center: `docs/history/platform-knowledge/`.) Tj
T*
(- Workforce planning/timetable/teachers/subjects: `docs/history/workforce-planning/`.) Tj
T*
(- Calendar: `docs/history/academic-calendar/`.) Tj
T*
(- Architecture/data model: `docs/engineering/REPOSITORY_ARCHITECTURE.md`,) Tj
T*
(`docs/engineering/DATABASE_ARCHITECTURE_OVERVIEW.md`.) Tj
T*
(- Design/UI: `docs/engineering/UI_UX_DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md`.) Tj
T*
(- Standards: `docs/engineering/DEVELOPMENT_STANDARDS.md`.) Tj
T*
