T*
() Tj
T*
(- treat it as design authority,) Tj
T*
(- do not reverse it casually,) Tj
T*
(- if a change conflicts with it, propose a new ADR or mark it superseded only with approval,) Tj
T*
(- link related docs/history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
