(## Avoiding Architectural Regressions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- merge SaaS account identity with operational users,) Tj
T*
(- treat checkout return as verified payment,) Tj
T*
(- provision tenants immediately from public signup,) Tj
T*
(- expose internal docs publicly,) Tj
T*
(- let platform developers act as platform owners,) Tj
T*
(- modify landing code during backend tasks,) Tj
T*
(- rewrite source docs from the running app,) Tj
T*
(- change database/migrations without explicit approval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
