() Tj
T*
(Create or update ADRs when:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- major accepted decisions are made,) Tj
T*
(- accepted decisions are superseded,) Tj
T*
(- architecture or product boundaries change.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use rejected decisions when important alternatives are intentionally declined.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Mandatory vs Optional Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mandatory:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- KIA in final report,) Tj
T*
(- docs update for meaningful changes,) Tj
T*
(- change history for meaningful changes,) Tj
T*
(- PDF/manifest regeneration when included docs change.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Conditional:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- ADR for major decisions,) Tj
T*
(- module history for area-specific state changes,) Tj
T*
(- AI context for first-read truth changes,) Tj
T*
(- engineering docs for handbook-level knowledge changes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Optional:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- visual docs until screenshots/diagrams are approved,) Tj
T*
(- local Git hooks; CI is authoritative because hooks are optional and bypassable.) Tj
T*
(- future search, semantic indexing, and documentation analytics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
