(- update ADRs if major decisions changed,) Tj
T*
(- update rejected decisions if an important alternative was declined,) Tj
T*
(- update AI project context if first-read truth changed,) Tj
T*
(- regenerate PDF/manifest,) Tj
T*
(- report validation.) Tj
T*
(- update `.kms-impact.yml` and run `scripts/check_kms_impact.py`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Examples) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Example: Docs Updated) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```md) Tj
T*
(Knowledge impact: Yes) Tj
T*
(Docs updated:) Tj
T*
(- docs/TIS_MASTER_CONTEXT.md) Tj
T*
(- docs/CHANGE_HISTORY.md) Tj
T*
(- docs/history/provisioning/...) Tj
T*
(Change history updated: Yes) Tj
T*
(ADR needed: No) Tj
T*
(Module history updated: Yes) Tj
T*
(PDF regenerated: Yes) Tj
T*
(AI project context updated: No) Tj
T*
(Reason if not updated: AI onboarding truth did not change.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Example: No Docs Needed) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```md) Tj
T*
(Knowledge impact: No) Tj
T*
(Docs updated: None) Tj
T*
(Change history updated: No) Tj
T*
(ADR needed: No) Tj
T*
(Module history updated: No) Tj
T*
(PDF regenerated: No) Tj
T*
(AI project context updated: No) Tj
T*
(Reason if not updated: Change was limited to a typo in an internal variable name and did not) Tj
T*
(affect behavior, architecture, workflow, roadmap, or developer knowledge.) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Approval Expectations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reviewers should reject final reports that omit KIA.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If docs were skipped, the reason must be specific. "Not needed" is not enough.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Failure Cases) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(KIA fails when:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- final report omits it,) Tj
T*
(- meaningful behavior changed but docs did not,) Tj
T*
(- docs changed but PDF/manifest were not regenerated,) Tj
T*
(- ADR-worthy decisions were hidden in code changes,) Tj
T*
(- module state changed without module history,) Tj
T*
(- AI context became stale after major onboarding truth changed.) Tj
T*
