T*
(## Developer Responsibilities) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Developers must:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- assess KIA honestly,) Tj
T*
(- update docs in the same task,) Tj
T*
(- keep generated artifacts current,) Tj
T*
(- avoid unrelated documentation churn,) Tj
T*
(- preserve historical truth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## AI Responsibilities) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI assistants must:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- read relevant docs before coding,) Tj
T*
(- identify likely KMS impact,) Tj
T*
(- not invent history,) Tj
T*
(- not silently skip docs,) Tj
T*
(- not commit or push unless requested,) Tj
T*
(- include KIA in every implementation final report.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
