T*
(  -> Knowledge Impact Assessment) Tj
T*
(  -> Update .kms-impact.yml) Tj
T*
(  -> Documentation Updates) Tj
T*
(  -> ADR if required) Tj
T*
(  -> Module History if required) Tj
T*
(  -> KMS Sync \(PDF + Manifest + Freshness\)) Tj
T*
(  -> KMS Read-Only Check) Tj
T*
(  -> Review) Tj
T*
(  -> Commit) Tj
T*
(  -> Push) Tj
T*
(  -> Deployment) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
