T*
() Tj
T*
(- objective,) Tj
T*
(- allowed files,) Tj
T*
(- forbidden files,) Tj
T*
(- validation requirements,) Tj
T*
(- documentation requirements,) Tj
T*
(- commit/push/deployment instructions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Implementation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implement only the approved scope.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Protect:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- tenant isolation,) Tj
T*
(- identity boundaries,) Tj
T*
(- payment/provisioning correctness,) Tj
T*
(- owner-only controls,) Tj
T*
(- landing boundaries,) Tj
T*
