(## Repository-Native Assistant Configuration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Root `AGENTS.md` remains the repository-wide governance authority. Claude Code) Tj
T*
(also reads root `CLAUDE.md`; its reusable project workflow lives at) Tj
T*
(`.claude/skills/tis-kms/SKILL.md`, and bounded delegated TIS work may use) Tj
T*
(`.claude/agents/tis-kms-developer.md`. These files point assistants back to this) Tj
T*
(KMS rather than embedding a separate architectural source of truth. Configuration) Tj
T*
(for another assistant must preserve the same KIA, safety, validation, and) Tj
T*
(completion-report requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Cline Setup And Use) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cline uses `.clinerules/tis.md` as always-on project rules and) Tj
T*
(`.cline/skills/tis-kms-developer/SKILL.md` as its reusable project skill.) Tj
T*
(Both defer to AGENTS.md and KMS, including task-level KIA, focused validation,) Tj
T*
(sync/check, worktree/database safety, and deployment reporting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Open TIS as the primary workspace folder. In Cline's Rules/Skills panel, ensure) Tj
T*
(the TIS project rule and skill are enabled; enable Skills in Settings > Features) Tj
T*
(if that option is present. Start a new task and select `/tis-kms-developer` from) Tj
T*
(slash suggestions, or ask to use the named skill. If it is not listed, explicitly) Tj
T*
(ask Cline to read the skill file; project rules still apply. The literal Codex) Tj
T*
(`$tis-kms-developer` token is not a documented Cline invocation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Check for a global skill with the same name, because Cline gives it precedence.) Tj
T*
(Cline can also discover `.claude/skills/tis-kms/`; it describes the same KMS) Tj
T*
(workflow and is not a second authority. Prefer the explicit Cline skill for Cline) Tj
T*
(tasks. No user-global settings, provider, account, or auto-approval defaults are) Tj
T*
(changed by these repository files.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Compatibility evidence \(2026-09-05\): installed VS Code Cline extension 4.1.17) Tj
T*
(includes SKILL.md parsing and use_skill support. Current official documentation) Tj
T*
(supports project rules, recommended .cline/skills storage, and slash invocation:) Tj
