T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
(adr: 0003) Tj
T*
(title: Paddle Payment Architecture) Tj
T*
(status: Accepted) Tj
T*
(date: 2026-06-26) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# ADR 0003: Paddle Payment Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status: Accepted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-06-26) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TIS requires subscription payments and billing visibility while preserving a clean boundary) Tj
T*
(between academic operations and payment provider behavior.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use Paddle behind service/client boundaries in the `saas/` package. Keep payment, pricing,) Tj
T*
(billing, and currency logic separate from academic modules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Active branch-quantity changes use `saas.subscription_change_service` and durable) Tj
T*
(`SubscriptionChangeRequest` records. TIS requests Paddle previews and never calculates) Tj
T*
(monetary proration. Immediate increases use `prorated_immediately` and prevent applying the) Tj
T*
(provider change when payment fails. Reductions are billed for the next period without an) Tj
T*
(automatic refund; TIS preserves current local capacity until the renewal boundary is) Tj
T*
(webhook-confirmed. Every update sends Paddle the complete retained recurring item list.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Plan upgrades and downgrades use the same provider-authoritative principles through) Tj
T*
(`saas.subscription_plan_change_service`. Upgrades are immediate only after) Tj
T*
(provider-confirmed payment lifecycle evidence; downgrades are scheduled and preserve current) Tj
T*
(entitlements until effective confirmation. Scheduled changes may be replaced or canceled) Tj
T*
(only while Paddle and local request state agree.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cancellation and reversal use `saas.subscription_cancellation_service`. Cancellation is) Tj
T*
(scheduled at period end, does not revoke current paid access early, and may be reversed) Tj
T*
(before the effective boundary after provider validation.) Tj
T*
(`saas.subscription_lifecycle_service` centralizes displayed lifecycle state and allowed) Tj
T*
(customer actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
