T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
(adr: 0008) Tj
T*
(title: Workspace Classification Foundation) Tj
T*
(status: Accepted) Tj
T*
(date: 2026-07-22) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# ADR 0008: Workspace Classification Foundation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status: Accepted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-07-22) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TIS needs a permanent distinction between internal sandbox, customer demo, and customer-paid) Tj
T*
(workspaces. Existing onboarding, payment, and provisioning statuses describe workflow) Tj
T*
(evidence, but none is a stable workspace classification authority. All records created) Tj
T*
(before M8B-1 are confirmed test data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Make `SchoolGroup` the canonical owner of stable workspace identity, classification, and) Tj
T*
(lifecycle metadata. Carry pre-provisioning intent on `PendingOrganization`, account purpose) Tj
T*
(on `SaaSAccount`, and internal-test attribution on operational `User`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(M8B-1 is metadata-only. Classification conversion is unavailable. No payment, entitlement,) Tj
T*
(permission, tenant-isolation, reset, or customer workflow consumes the new fields. Existing) Tj
T*
(records are classified through an explicit dry-run/default, transactional, idempotent) Tj
T*
(backfill as internal sandbox/test data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Positive:) Tj
T*
(- Later workspace policies have one constrained metadata foundation.) Tj
T*
(- Stable UUIDs separate workspace identity from numeric database IDs.) Tj
T*
(- Existing test data is explicitly classified without a legacy/unknown state.) Tj
T*
(- Platform Owners can inspect metadata without receiving mutation controls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tradeoffs:) Tj
T*
(- M8B-1 does not yet enforce commercial separation.) Tj
T*
(- Deployment requires running and reviewing the controlled data backfill after schema) Tj
T*
(migration.) Tj
T*
(- Workspace conversions require a later approved package.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
