(SOURCE: docs/adr/0009-commercial-state-and-entitlement-resolution.md) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
(adr: 0009) Tj
T*
(title: Commercial State And Entitlement Resolution) Tj
T*
(status: Accepted) Tj
T*
(date: 2026-07-22) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# ADR 0009: Commercial State And Entitlement Resolution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status: Accepted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-07-22) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Workspace classification identifies what a workspace is, but it must not be conflated with) Tj
T*
(lifecycle, subscription evidence, feature values, or branch commercial activity. Future demo) Tj
T*
(and paid workflows require one conservative resolution boundary before access enforcement is) Tj
T*
(introduced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Represent the effective commercial grant with `WorkspaceEntitlement`, typed values through) Tj
T*
(`WorkspaceEntitlementValue` and the existing `EntitlementDefinition` catalog, and optional) Tj
T*
(per-branch intent through `BranchEntitlement`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Resolve commercial state read-only from SchoolGroup classification/lifecycle and one) Tj
T*
(coherent workspace entitlement. Customer-paid resolution delegates plan features, quantity,) Tj
T*
(and confirmed subscription ownership to the existing M7 entitlement resolver. Branches) Tj
T*
(inherit by default; an explicit branch record may state active or inactive but must match) Tj
T*
(the branch tenant and effective workspace entitlement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(M8B-2 does not enforce the result. Missing, invalid, ambiguous, stale, orphaned, or) Tj
T*
(cross-tenant evidence returns manual review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Positive:) Tj
T*
(- One extensible commercial decision contract can support later demo and paid workflows.) Tj
T*
(- Existing M7 subscription authority is preserved.) Tj
T*
(- Branch commercial intent remains separate from operational branch status.) Tj
T*
(- Read-only resolution can be inspected safely before enforcement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tradeoffs:) Tj
T*
(- Existing internal development workspaces need a compatibility entitlement until all) Tj
T*
(creation paths persist grants.) Tj
T*
(- Demo expiration and customer access behavior remain deliberately incomplete.) Tj
T*
(- Platform review is required for inconsistent persisted relationships.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Related Docs / Files) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `commercial_entitlements.py`) Tj
T*
(- `saas/models.py`) Tj
T*
