(# ADR 0010: Review-Only SaaS Demo Requests Before Provisioning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(M8B-3 introduces a customer demo-request workflow after onboarding, while demo provisioning) Tj
T*
(and activation remain explicitly deferred to M8B-4. Existing public marketing demo leads,) Tj
T*
(SaaS onboarding organizations, operational workspaces, and paid subscriptions have different) Tj
T*
(ownership and lifecycle boundaries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use a dedicated `SaaSDemoRequest` aggregate tied to the verified SaaS requester and) Tj
T*
(`PendingOrganization`. Capture classification, commercial-state, and entitlement context at) Tj
T*
(submission. Store Platform Owner approval/rejection in a separate review record and every) Tj
T*
(transition in append-only audit/internal-notification events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Approval is review evidence only. It must not create a `SchoolGroup`, workspace entitlement,) Tj
T*
(checkout, payment record, Paddle object, or provisioning job. Subscribe Now continues the) Tj
T*
(existing payment workflow unchanged. The legacy public marketing `DemoRequest` remains) Tj
T*
(independent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Customer and Platform Owner views have a durable, permission-scoped request lifecycle.) Tj
T*
(- Duplicate pending requests and invalid transitions fail closed.) Tj
