() Tj
T*
(M8B-4 must create an operational customer-demo workspace after Platform Owner approval. The) Tj
T*
(existing tenant-provisioning link required a paid subscription contract, but a demo has no) Tj
T*
(Paddle or billing obligation. Fabricating a contract would weaken commercial-state) Tj
