(# ADR 0013: Demo-To-Paid Workspace Conversion) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A provisioned Customer Demo already owns the customer's operational SchoolGroup, branches,) Tj
T*
(users, permissions, academic data, and audit history. Running the paid provisioning engine) Tj
T*
(after subscription payment would either skip the existing demo tenant without establishing) Tj
T*
(paid commercial ownership or risk creating a duplicate tenant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Convert only an active, coherently provisioned Customer Demo after TIS receives a) Tj
T*
(provider-confirmed active M7 subscription for the same pending organization. A durable) Tj
T*
(conversion ledger records Requested, Processing, Completed, and Failed states plus audit and) Tj
T*
(internal-notification events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The conversion runs in one nested database transaction. It preserves the SchoolGroup,) Tj
T*
(workspace UUID, tenant link row, organization, branches, users, permissions, academic) Tj
T*
(records, and history. It ends the demo entitlement, creates a subscription-backed paid) Tj
T*
(entitlement, moves existing branch entitlement rows to that envelope, changes the workspace) Tj
T*
(classification to Customer Paid, and relinks the existing tenant link to the confirmed) Tj
T*
(subscription contract.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The transaction validates its result through the existing M7 subscription entitlement) Tj
T*
(resolver, workspace entitlement resolver, and commercial-state resolver. It succeeds only) Tj
T*
(when the same workspace resolves as Customer Paid Active with the confirmed subscription and) Tj
T*
(sufficient purchased branch capacity. A failure rolls back every workspace conversion) Tj
T*
(mutation while retaining provider-confirmed payment records and a retryable failed) Tj
T*
(conversion audit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Expired-demo plan selection resolves the existing operational workspace and its) Tj
T*
(authoritative active branch quantity. It enters the existing checkout and) Tj
T*
(conversion ledger, never onboarding or a second workspace. Missing plan or) Tj
T*
(branch configuration fails safely with support guidance while preserving all) Tj
T*
(tenant data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- No tenant, workspace, organization, user, branch, permission, or academic record is) Tj
T*
(recreated.) Tj
T*
(- Demo request, provisioning, lifecycle, reminder, and expiration history remains available.) Tj
T*
(- Completed conversions are excluded from demo reminder and expiration processing.) Tj
T*
(- Existing paid provisioning remains unchanged for organizations without a demo tenant link.) Tj
T*
(- Ambiguous, cross-tenant, internal-sandbox, or already-paid workspaces fail closed.) Tj
T*
(- Manual conversion overrides, demo extensions, workspace deletion, and unrelated billing) Tj
T*
(changes remain out of scope.) Tj
