(# ADR 0014: Demo Customer Communications And Approval Orchestration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(M8B-3 through M8B-6 established review, provisioning, lifecycle enforcement, and) Tj
T*
(same-workspace paid conversion, but deliberately omitted customer lifecycle email, shared) Tj
T*
(Notification Center delivery, a workspace-wide demo indicator, approval-driven activation,) Tj
T*
(and expired-demo continuation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(M8B7 makes the normal Platform Owner approval route orchestrate the existing approval and) Tj
T*
(provisioning services. Approval evidence remains separate from provisioning, and a failed) Tj
T*
(activation preserves an Approved request plus the existing owner-only retry action. An) Tj
T*
(approval email intent is created only after activation succeeds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Demo communications use the existing branded email renderer and provider through a durable) Tj
T*
(`SaaSDemoEmailDelivery` outbox. Logical events are uniquely deduplicated and provider calls) Tj
T*
(occur after lifecycle transactions. Platform Owner events use the existing Notification) Tj
T*
(Center with explicit destinations and deduplication keys.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The shared authenticated shell resolves active Customer Demo state through the existing) Tj
T*
(lifecycle resolver and shows a persistent demo indicator only to tenant identities. Expired) Tj
T*
(access remains blocked.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A coherent expired Customer Demo may enter the existing Paddle checkout flow. Only) Tj
T*
(authoritative confirmed payment converts and reactivates the same SchoolGroup, workspace) Tj
T*
(UUID, tenant link, branches, users, permissions, and tenant data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Request, approval, decline, reminder, expiry, and continuation communications are durable) Tj
T*
(and retryable.) Tj
T*
(- Normal approval creates exactly one operational workspace; failed provisioning remains) Tj
T*
(independently retryable.) Tj
T*
(- Scheduler delay never extends access.) Tj
T*
(- Expired customers can subscribe without tenant reprovisioning.) Tj
T*
(- Sandbox, checkout-return, and unverified payment evidence cannot establish Customer Paid) Tj
T*
(state.) Tj
T*
(- M8B8 AI demo limits and M8B9 lifecycle testing controls remain out of scope.) Tj
T*
