T*
() Tj
T*
(# ADR 0015: Centralized AI Entitlements And Usage Accounting) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Context) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TIS has workspace classification, commercial-state resolution, normalized paid) Tj
T*
(plan entitlements, and role permissions, but no single authority for future AI) Tj
T*
(features or demo usage. Route-local feature names and counters would risk) Tj
T*
(cross-tenant leakage, inconsistent plan rules, and double consumption.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`saas/ai_entitlement_service.py` is the sole AI entitlement and consumption) Tj
T*
(authority. Its decision order is tenant/workspace scope, underlying permission,) Tj
T*
(commercial state, registered AI policy, then successful-use consumption.) Tj
T*
(Commercial and demo-expiry denial remains authoritative before allowance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`saas/ai_feature_registry.py` defines stable feature keys, display names,) Tj
T*
(permission and entitlement keys, eligible plan codes, demo allowance, and) Tj
T*
(enabled state. The temporary reviewed tier mapping grants registered AI) Tj
T*
(features to `enterprise_ai`; Starter and Professional receive upgrade guidance.) Tj
T*
(No price or AI business feature is introduced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Each active Customer Demo receives two successful uses per registered feature.) Tj
T*
(Evaluation never consumes. Before provider execution, callers reserve an) Tj
T*
(operation key; locked successful-plus-reserved capacity prevents concurrent) Tj
T*
(attempts from exceeding the allowance. Completion converts the reservation to) Tj
T*
(a successful use only for a usable result, or marks it failed and releases the) Tj
T*
(capacity. Durable counters and operation events are unique by SchoolGroup,) Tj
T*
(feature, metric context, and operation key as applicable. Internal Sandbox,) Tj
T*
(demo, and paid metrics use separate contexts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Permissions, commercial access, and AI entitlement remain separate checks.) Tj
T*
(- Unknown, disabled, expired, restricted, non-entitled, and unauthorized cases) Tj
T*
(  fail closed with explicit reason codes.) Tj
T*
(- Demo exhaustion returns the approved message and Subscribe Now destination.) Tj
T*
(- Internal Sandbox is unlimited but separately measured.) Tj
T*
(- No failed/no-result operation consumes usage.) Tj
T*
(- Future M8B9 controls may inspect or extend the persisted model, but M8B8 adds) Tj
T*
(  no reset, override, expiry, reminder, or lifecycle-control interface.) Tj
T*
(- No executable AI feature currently exists, so no customer AI route is added.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
