(---) Tj
T*
(title: ADR 0016 - Pre-Deploy Database Migration Boundary) Tj
T*
(documentation_version: 1.1) Tj
T*
(last_updated: 2026-09-09) Tj
T*
(status: accepted) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# ADR 0016 - Pre-Deploy Database Migration Boundary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The TIS FastAPI web process does not create database tables or execute pending) Tj
T*
(migrations during module import, FastAPI startup, middleware, request handling,) Tj
T*
(or background threads. Render executes `python scripts/run_migrations.py` as) Tj
T*
(the service Pre-Deploy Command. The command creates the repository's baseline) Tj
T*
(SQLAlchemy metadata schema while excluding tables owned by ordered migrations,) Tj
T*
(then executes) Tj
T*
(`db_migrations.run_pending_migrations\(engine\)`, logs newly applied migration) Tj
T*
(identifiers, and exits nonzero on any failure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Render activates the new web version only after this command exits zero. The) Tj
T*
(web Start Command remains) Tj
T*
(`uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Rationale) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PostgreSQL DDL can wait on table locks for longer than Render's port-detection) Tj
T*
(window. Running DDL inside the web process couples schema lock duration to) Tj
T*
(service availability and previously required a process-local readiness gate.) Tj
T*
(A platform pre-deploy step provides the required ordering without exposing a) Tj
T*
(partially migrated schema or delaying Uvicorn's bind.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Every deployment must configure the migration command before the Start) Tj
T*
(  Command is allowed to activate.) Tj
T*
(- Migration failure blocks deployment with a nonzero exit code.) Tj
T*
(- Repeated execution is safe because metadata creation is check-first and the) Tj
T*
(  ordered migration ledger is idempotent.) Tj
T*
(- Student/Talent tables are owned by the ordered ledger and excluded from) Tj
T*
(  baseline metadata creation. Migration `20260904_000` establishes legacy) Tj
T*
(  Branch/Academic-Year/existing-Student composite unique parent keys before) Tj
T*
(  `20260904_001` creates tenant-scoped Student relationships.) Tj
T*
(- A migration and its ledger marker share one transaction. Duplicate) Tj
T*
(  prerequisite data or invalid DDL therefore fails without a marker or data) Tj
T*
(  rewrite and blocks web activation.) Tj
T*
