(The result supports educator review and may coexist with deterministic Review) Tj
T*
(Candidate policy. It does not itself create an Official Identification decision.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Official Identification remains a separate authorized human decision. Neither a) Tj
T*
(rubric average nor its color treatment is an automatic `talented/not talented`) Tj
T*
