T*
(hazards such as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- full large-dataset parsing for normal picker requests,) Tj
T*
(- duplicate template rendering in production routes,) Tj
T*
(- warning-level diagnostic stage logs during normal traffic,) Tj
T*
(- unbounded global caches,) Tj
T*
(- startup-heavy work without memory review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
