T*
(# TIS Location Data Roadmap) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Phase 1: Global Form Usability) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status: implemented in the current working tree.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phase 1 intentionally keeps location data attached directly to an organization) Tj
T*
(or branch. It does not create shared locality records.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Included:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Controlled country selection from the local dataset.) Tj
T*
(- Controlled region/state/province selection when dataset coverage exists.) Tj
T*
(- Dataset-backed city/locality selection.) Tj
T*
(- `Other / manual entry` fallback for missing regions and cities.) Tj
T*
(- Optional district and neighborhood fields, stored separately from city.) Tj
T*
(- Local cached APIs; no external location API dependency at runtime.) Tj
T*
(- Existing text location fields remain compatible with legacy Saudi data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Manual region and city values are record-level values. They are not published) Tj
T*
(to other tenants and are not added to the imported dataset.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Deferred Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The following phases are roadmap items only. They are not part of Phase 1 and) Tj
T*
(must not be inferred from the current text-based storage model.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Locality Registry) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create stable TIS locality identifiers and canonical locality records that are) Tj
T*
(independent from vendor dataset identifiers. Organizations and branches would) Tj
T*
(eventually reference these records while retaining display-name snapshots for) Tj
T*
(audit and migration compatibility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Locality Aliases) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Support native names, translated names, transliterations, spelling variants,) Tj
T*
(and historical names. Alias matching should be region-aware and must not merge) Tj
T*
(places solely because their normalized names match.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### GeoNames and Official Dataset Enrichment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Build an offline enrichment process using GeoNames country dumps and, where) Tj
T*
(available, official national gazetteers. Source priority, licensing,) Tj
T*
(attribution, place classification, and duplicate resolution must be defined) Tj
T*
(before combining records.) Tj
T*
